# Brewfile — cross-platform package manifest.
# brew formulae + uv tools + npm globals + go packages. Installs via
# 'brew bundle' on macOS AND Ubuntu (Linuxbrew). GUI casks + VS Code
# extensions are macOS-only and live in Brewfile.macos.

